 "structural_change": "QW-COLLIO 10-20 bandw: codec-band successor of qfd_coll_face_s1_safe (FAIL: codec0 TT pin spread 450.8 ps / CTS rc2; s1 r4: reach 554 um, spread 306, reg->macro -551). Root cause: no codec std-cell region - 4 W-pinned banks sat between the CDC channels and the PHY pins (950 um flow axis), so codec0 sinks scattered over every macro channel. Now W->E flow: W pins -> CDC column (ch546 TX R0 / RX MY, banks 0/1 MY with pins facing the band) -> dedicated full-height codec band 241.9 um -> banks 2/3 R0 (pins facing band) -> PHY pins on E (<=260 um over banks). No rotated macros. Same SAFE=1 RTL/bench as s1_safe.",
 "slot_change_request": "face S1 777.6x864.0 (was 950.4x561.6); production parent places it with PHY side E, core side W.",
 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude:QW-COLLIO",
  "branch": "claude/qw-collio-1020",
  "tag": "bandw",
  "purpose": "S1 face codec-band successor (QW-COLLIO); non-critical; submit on PASS",
